  "394": {
    "inputs": {
      "text": "Perform a restrained professional photographic refinement of the provided image.\n\nTreat the input as the final composition and preserve it exactly. Do not regenerate, redesign or reinterpret the subject or the scene.\n\nMaintain unchanged:\n\n- facial identity and facial geometry\n- hairstyle, hairline, hair length and hair color\n- eye shape and eye color\n- body shape and proportions\n- facial expression and gaze direction\n- pose, hands and finger positions\n- clothing, accessories and materials\n- background, objects and their positions\n- camera angle, framing, crop and perspective\n- lighting direction, color palette and atmosphere\n\nApply only subtle, localized photographic corrections:\n\n- restore natural fine skin texture, pores, peach fuzz and realistic tonal variation\n- remove waxy, plastic or overly smooth synthetic-looking skin\n- improve iris detail, sclera texture, corneal reflections and tear-line realism\n- refine individual hair strands, roots, eyelashes, eyebrows and flyaway hairs\n- improve fabric weave, stitching, seams, folds and material definition\n- correct small anatomical irregularities and minor AI-generated artifacts\n- improve contact shadows, ambient occlusion, reflections and material response\n- recover fine details without creating sharpening halos\n- reduce digital noise, color banding, smearing and compression artifacts\n- balance exposure, white balance and local contrast naturally\n- preserve realistic depth of field and lens behavior\n- apply subtle professional photographic color grading\n\nThe final result must look like a clean, high-resolution photograph captured by a professional full-frame camera. Keep natural skin texture and realistic imperfections. Avoid beauty-filter aesthetics, excessive sharpness, HDR or artificial contrast.\n\nThis is a restoration and refinement pass only. Do not change the content of the image.",
